; Opera Agent - removes the registry trigger keys, nothing else.
; @last-edited: 2026-11-14 UTC+7.
; @title: extension registry uninstall - deletes the four keys that ask Chrome, Brave, Edge and Chrome for Testing to install the extension.
; @state: Windows; per-user (HKCU). Verified 2026-11-12 alongside extension-registry-install.reg.
; @dependencies: none.
; NOTE: this removes only the "please install" request. An extension already installed stays installed until you remove it at chrome://extensions (or brave://extensions, edge://extensions), per browser.

Windows Registry Editor Version 5.00

[-HKEY_CURRENT_USER\Software\Google\Chrome\Extensions\ofgemipoobcnbjkfanmofjbdonjapmgl]

[-HKEY_CURRENT_USER\Software\Google\Chrome for Testing\Extensions\ofgemipoobcnbjkfanmofjbdonjapmgl]

[-HKEY_CURRENT_USER\Software\BraveSoftware\Brave-Browser\Extensions\ofgemipoobcnbjkfanmofjbdonjapmgl]

[-HKEY_CURRENT_USER\Software\Microsoft\Edge\Extensions\ofgemipoobcnbjkfanmofjbdonjapmgl]
